The accepted contract adds one key constraint beyond the task text: credential format IDs are intentionally still unassigned by the downstream key-format owner. I’ll therefore implement the full binary record decoder and an injected format-registry seam, supporting both imported and generated representations in tests without inventing a production format number; the production resolver will fail closed as `credentialKeyUnsupported` until that registry is supplied.
